- integrity and gates;
- a note-by-note diff against the round-1 file (git HEAD, SHA-256 175bee75…);
- pitch bands for every attack in bars 64–71, with the bar-68 placement and bar 65 checked specifically;
- a register-aware per-bar lag scan of the whole map;
- two fresh reviewer overlays;
- a code reading of the site-side end-of-score fix.
The source, the three token corrections, the opening, the ending and the sheet pack were reviewed in round 1 and are unchanged. Not aural review; no browser run.

